   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation and active use of simultaneity",
     "texto": [
      "The Partizip I is formed by adding a **-d** to the verb's infinitive, followed by the corresponding adjectival ending:",
      "- **zunehmen → zunehmend- → die zunehmende Belastung** (the growing burden).",
      "- **steigen → steigend- → mit steigenden Kosten** (with rising costs).",
      "- **pendeln → pendelnd- → die pendelnden Arbeitnehmer** (the commuting workers).",
      "Unlike in English, where the «-ing» form is only one of several options, in German the Partizip I is fully productive for any action or process verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
